name starray
category Package
revision 70599
shortdesc A structured array (of properties) based on expl3
relocated 1
longdesc This package implements vector-like 'structures', like in 'C'
longdesc and other programming languages. So it is possible to store
longdesc information in a systematic and regular way. The provided
longdesc 'functions' are similar to the ones provided for property (or
longdesc sequence, or token) lists. The package is based on expl3 and
longdesc aimed at package authors, not end users. The name "starray" is
longdesc an abbreviation for "structured arrays".
runfiles size=17
 RELOC/tex/latex/starray/starray.sty
